<templates xml:space="preserve">

  <!-- Variant 1: अगर header में groups बने हुए हैं, तो सबसे पहले group से पहले हमारा group insert करें -->
  <t t-inherit="mail.Discuss" t-inherit-mode="extension">
    <xpath expr="//div[contains(@class,'o-mail-Discuss-headerActions')]/span[contains(@class,'o-mail-Discuss-headerActionsGroup')][1]" position="before">
      <span class="o-mail-Discuss-headerActionsGroup btn-group border border-dark">
        <button type="button"
                class="btn px-3 btn-group-item btn-secondary bg-inherit m-0 border-0 o_aebo_PurgeChat"
                t-att-data-thread-id="thread.id"
                title="Delete chat for everyone">
          <i class="fa fa-trash fa-lg"/>
        </button>
      </span>
      <!-- group separator (same look as बाकी separaters) -->
      <span class="text-muted align-self-stretch ms-2 me-1"/>
    </xpath>
  </t>
</templates>